<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of French barley export bids.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of French barley export bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders gave the following cumulative breakdown for European Union barley export bids submitted via France on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Cumulative tonnage	Refund (Ecus/tonne)</p>
<p>     25,000		     27.98</p>
<p>    109,000		     28.98</p>
<p>    144,000		     29.28</p>
<p>    146,000		     30.25</p>
<p>    246,000		     31.83</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
